-            <h4>11. 报告人：夏海峰 中山大学副教授</h4>
-            <div class="speaker-profile">
-                <div class="speaker-image">
-                    <img src="./images/academic-forum/学术论坛/夏海峰.png" alt="夏海峰头像" onerror="this.src='./images/academic-forum/default.png'">
